# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# Same fire, different element, purely by ramp: Doom Fire keyed into toxic
# green and boxed to the cauldron's mouth, the cauldron sprite occluding its
# base (index 0 is the only transparency a sprite has).
S - Witch's Cauldron
L color 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Night
K 0c0614
L pat 9 0 14 23 normal 100 none fill 1
N Brew fire
I @pat/doom-fire
C sliderFlameHeightPct 6553600
R 100 0:0c0614 80:0b3d0b 160:39ff14 230:c6ff8a 255:ffffff
L color 0 31 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Floor
K 140c18
L sprite 8 21 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Cauldron
I @spr/cauldron
L text 0 1 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N Chant
T lit DOUBLE DOUBLE
F tiny 9dff7a l left 10
